"""Mutants of the car, the traffic, collisions and close calls (GDD 5.1 to
5.7) for the M2 tests: T-CAR-01..05, T-COL-01..03 and T-CC-01..02. They
are what was left of the M2 review's "test honesty" findings (2026-11-17),
put as changes a test has to notice.
    python3 tools/mutants.py T-CAR,T-COL,T-CC tools/mutants/m2_car.py

Equivalent, and so not in the list:
  - `since_close_call < _chain_window` for `<=`: the seconds are a sum of
    ticks, and 480 ticks of 1/120 s sum to a hair under 4.0, never to 4.0.
    T-CC-01 holds the window to the tick: 480 ticks chain, 481 do not.
"""
